= [+ date_label +] — Cold, not fatal

The briefings stop. Not because either office surrendered, but because the two
people involved have too much shared history for a war of destruction. [? if
war_top_president = "Adrian Zandberg" and war_top_pm = "Magdalena Biejat": The
President and the Prime Minister founded the same party. They have argued in
public since before either held an office worth fighting over, and both know
what the other would have to say to finish the job.?][? if war_top_president !=
"Adrian Zandberg" or war_top_pm != "Magdalena Biejat": Both offices concluded
that the cost of proving who leads the camp exceeded the value of the answer.?]

**[+ war_top_president +]** keeps the prerogatives and stops advertising them.
**[+ war_top_pm +]** keeps the Chancellery and stops treating every presidential
appearance as an act of sabotage. The rivalry remains on the record and will be
read into every future nomination, but no third party inherits the wreckage.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the settlement


